& [SelectedRevision] is a breaking pure schema correction
  + [receipt_profile] is a new exact receipt-schema profile
  + [scanner_profile] separately binds cantor-windows-candidate-topology/0.1
  + [root_identity] is StrongFileIdentity
  + [root_volume_guid_path] is bounded, NUL-free, and structurally identified as a volume-GUID absolute path
  + [candidate_root] remains the exact Phase3A canonical human and reopen address
  + [admission_profile] and [admission_receipt_sha256] remain exact predecessor bindings
  + [policy_sha256] and [ordered_inventory_sha256] remain exact semantic and evidence bindings

& [Versioning] must be honest
  + [receipt_schema] receives a new profile rather than silently changing the existing JSON contract
  + [forms_profile] receives a new version if its public vocabulary changes
  + [scanner_policy] remains version 0.1 because this correction changes evidence binding rather than physical admission policy
  + [old_receipt] remains decodable only through an explicitly named legacy type or is rejected as unsupported; the SJS decision must choose
  - never: accept old JSON as though it carried the new root evidence

& [Validation] is pure
  + [root_identity] uses the existing exact 128-bit form
  + [root_volume_guid_path] validates syntax only and does not claim the path exists or matches identity
  + [cross_field] receipt candidate root, final path, and identity truth remains the future scanner's responsibility
  + [strict_JSON] rejects missing new fields and unknown fields

& [TestDelta] is focused
  + [profile] rejects the former conflated field shape
  + [identity] rejects missing or malformed root identity
  + [final_path] rejects relative, DOS, UNC, device, NT, malformed GUID, missing terminal separator, NUL, and over-bound values
  + [round_trip] preserves exact receipt schema and scanner profiles separately
  + [nonclaim] proves only form coherence

& [Boundary] remains effect-free
  + [allowed_next] is source manifest, SJS, justification, pure code revision, tests, evidence, proof, and rollback
  + [forbidden] is dependency change, unsafe, Windows API, filesystem, clock, random, process, network, model, scanner execution, fixture, sandbox, mutation, seal, cleanup, and promotion

